### tylermcm/WonderLanternZ7 — see repository
<https://github.com/tylermcm/WonderLanternZ7>

A Z7 lab record. Its flash assessment documents a failed candidate ("Latest
result: failed", continuous live-view sound and capture-audio busy) and states
that emergency recovery is unverified. That record is the main source for this
repository's risk section: it is the reason the current aspect candidates are
marked not-for-flashing.

